note ==== page.om: every page and panel is drawn here, by Omega, as escaped HTML. The browser runs
note no script at all (CSP has no script source): panels are iframes that re-fetch themselves with
note <meta http-equiv=refresh>, and typing goes through a plain HTML form to POST /send.
note All text that came from outside (pane captures, files, command output, query values) goes
note through vwhe, which writes & < > " ' as entities and drops control bytes.
global gh uchar 262144
global ghl ulong 1
global gix uchar 32768
global gixl ulong 1
global gq uchar 1024
global gql ulong 1
global gnow ulong 1
global gcsrf uchar 64
global gcsrfk ulong 1
global gst ulong 4
global gsp ulong 4
global gsv ulong 16
global gsvn ulong 1
global gtl uchar 4096
global gtll ulong 1
global gpp ulong 8
global gks uchar 768
global gksl ulong 16
global gkc ulong 16
global gkn ulong 1
global glan uchar 3072
global glanl ulong 64
global glann ulong 1
text thamp "&amp;"
text thlt "&lt;"
text thgt "&gt;"
text thquo "&quot;"
text thapo "&#39;"
